# Build-context excludes for the Docker image (docker/Dockerfile).
# Goal: bake a lean, reproducible snapshot of the repo source while leaving out
# local state, caches, secrets, and large runtime-only output dirs.
#
# NOTE: this file governs every `docker build` whose context is the repo root.
# Keep it to *exclusions only* — anything not listed here is copied into the
# image at `COPY . /opt/rlm-base-dev`.
#
# The published image is built from a CI checkout, which never contains a
# git-ignored path. A local build (`docker/rlm setup`, the devcontainer) uses
# the working tree as its context instead, so every .gitignore entry is mirrored
# here, or it is baked into the image. Mind the scope when mirroring one:
#   - Docker anchors every pattern at the context root. A .gitignore pattern with
#     no slash except a trailing one (`.env`, `*.log`, `.sf/`) matches at any
#     depth, so it is mirrored as `**/<pattern>`; one with a leading or middle
#     slash is anchored and mirrored as is.
#   - A bare path excludes the whole subtree; `dir/**` would still leave the
#     empty directory behind, so the trailing `/` or `/**` is dropped.
# tests/test_dockerignore.py fails on a .gitignore entry that is not mirrored with
# that scope, on a sample of each private class that would still be copied, and
# on any tracked file these patterns would drop.

# Version control + CI noise
.git
.gitattributes
.github

# Agent session state. Only the tracked .claude files belong in the image;
# worktrees/ alone holds full repo copies, settings.local.json is per user.
# Keep this block (and any other `!` re-include) ABOVE every other rule: Docker
# applies the last pattern that matches, so a re-include placed later would bring
# back a nested secret (.claude/hooks/.env, .claude/skills/x/.sf/...) that the
# recursive rules below exclude.
.claude/*
!.claude/skill-manifest.yml
!.claude/commands
!.claude/skills
!.claude/settings.json
!.claude/hooks

# Local Python / Node toolchains (reinstalled inside the image)
**/.venv
**/venv
**/node_modules
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
.pytest_cache
.ruff_cache
.mypy_cache

# Local environment / secret files (NEVER bake into layers)
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.key
**/*.pem

# Salesforce / CumulusCI local auth + keychain + caches (NEVER bake secrets)
**/.sf
**/.sfdx
**/.cci
**/.cumulusci
**/.localdevserver
**/deploy-options.json

# Build-harness run artifacts + scenario workspaces
**/.harness

# Runtime-only extract outputs (regenerated by extract_* tasks)
datasets/bre
datasets/dx

